														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1576682">
									

<blockquote>
<p>pure energy</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Fix that. There is no such thing, and it won't be long before someone less friendly than I brings it up.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>in containment for ██ years and show no signs of deteriorating.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Unneeded black box. Trust me, I've been shot down for the same thing.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>6 serious injuries and █ fatalities</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Equally unneeded and relatively unambiguous - it's 1 to 9. And the number of deaths is not a secret, especially if injuries are listed.</p>
<p>Aside from that, needs some proofreading.</p>

